## PROJECT STRUCTURE KEY:
- `el/` — core Python package (pipeline, nodes, providers, web API)
- `legacy/` — original n8n workflows (source of truth)
- `migrations/` — SQL migrations for Supabase
- `scripts/` — build, calibration, verification, deploy scripts
- `tests/` — 805+ pytest tests, 90%+ coverage
- `docs/superpowers/specs/` — SP design specifications
- `docs/superpowers/plans/` — SP implementation plans
- `docs/runbooks/` — operational runbooks (deploy, shopify, etc)
- `paper/` — academic paper (LaTeX)
- `gui/` — Windows desktop GUI (CustomTkinter), single-file .exe wrapper

## COMMANDS:
```powershell
# Run tests
python -m pytest tests/ -q

# Preview trends
python -m el trends --top 10 --json

# Forge supplier preview
python -m el forge --query "RCB jersey" --json

# Sentinel preview (Forge + vetting + HIL bridge)
python -m el sentinel --query "RCB jersey" --json

# Verify env
python scripts/verify_env.py

# Docker compose
docker compose up -d

# Build GUI .exe (from repo root)
.\gui\build.ps1
```

